        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} y (0) = A + B + \\frac {1}{6} = - 2 \\\\ y (- 1) = - A - \\frac {B}{2} + \\frac {1}{6} = 1 \\end{array} \\Rightarrow A = \\frac {1}{2}, B = - \\frac {8}{3} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
